'''Vysnagosa's Rest''' is an island found off the [[Whispering Shores]] of [[Moonwhisper Coast]]. After the [[Blue dragonflight]] called down an arcane meteor that crashed in [[Starshard Cradle]],<ref>[https://discord.com/channels/466622455805378571/895751435797536788/1496783160149540866 Moriena from the Turtle WoW Community Discord] - "its a meteor called down by the blue dragons"</ref> the island was occupied by draconic forces led by the blue dragon [[Avranagos]].

